externalValues.description:
Custom field values mapped by External Property ID. Pass as a JSON object with property IDs as string keys. Example: { "1": "Sales Team", "2": "High Priority", "3": null }

A key-value map where keys are int (serialized as strings in JSON) and values are string.

Example: { "1": "value1", "2": "value2", "3": null }

